<p>This tutorial describes how to create a custom <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Placeable" title="Placeable">Placeable</a> based on a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Model" title="Model">Model</a> that is already active in your toolset. This process should work with any model, whether custom or packaged with the game. It is assumed that the reader is familiar with the Toolset.
</p>
